=2 Walkthrough
* Before heading out, farm {m:Boulder Eaters|Boulder Eater} in {z:Gustav Tunnel} at (J-6) Map 2 to get 6 {@i:Fat Worm Meat|9936} {i:Fat Worm Meat|Fat Worm Meat|9936}. You will need these for Dazbog.
** The Unity Warp 128 will put you on the correct map.
*** The drop rate is around **{p:U|Uncommon (10%)}** with {p:Treasure Hunter}.
*** They are {E} Exclusive, so they cannot be purchased.
* Head to Map 4 of {z:Gusgen Mines} (Same Map that {m:Juggler Hecatomb} spawns on) and speak with {n:Hedrov} (H-7) for a cutscene.
** Fastest way is to use the {p:Survival Guide} and walk towards exit A.
*** Once on the next map keep on the left and go down the tunnel at G to reach map #4.
** Alternatively you can run through Tunnel B, then through Tunnel E and go west to Drop H when you enter Map 3. Drop down this hole and you'll be next to {n:Hedrov}.
*** {n:Hedrov} is in the middle of the room behind a shed.
* Trade the 6 {@i:Fat Worm Meat|9936} {i:Fat Worm Meats|Fat Worm Meat|9936} to {n:Hedrov} for a cutscene and reward.

